## Instructions

### System Requirements

Ensure the following tools are installed on your system before building:

- A C compiler (`cc`)
- GNU `make`
- `ar` (static library archiver, pre-installed on Linux and macOS)
- `norminette` (42 Norm checker)

### Project Rules

| Rule                  | Description                                                                |
|-----------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Norm                  | Every `.c` and `.h` file must pass `norminette`                            |
| Compilation flags     | All sources are compiled with `-Wall -Wextra -Werror`                      |
| Allowed functions     | Only the functions listed in each exercise may be used                     |
| Turn-in directory     | No extra files may be left in an exercise directory                        |
| Shell exercises       | Must be executable with `/bin/sh`                                          |
| `main()` function     | Only submitted when the exercise explicitly asks for a program             |
| `ft_putchar`          | When allowed, it is provided by the evaluation (`ft_putchar.c`)            |

